    "narrative": "The Austin Waves offense faces a volatile slate today, with **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** headlining the lineup as the clear top play (74.56). Facing the vulnerable arm of Ryan Feltner, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** benefits from a significant platoon advantage and a favorable spot in the heart of the order, projecting as a high-floor producer capable of carrying the day in the counting categories. **Drake Baldwin** follows closely (69.17) as he leadoffs against Nick Martinez; his combination of high-volume plate appearances and a favorable park factor makes him an essential start, particularly with the 16% SP skill adjustment inflating his potential for multi-hit efficiency. **Heliot Ramos** (66.90) rounds out the high-confidence tier, and notably, his score is bolstered by a 2% boost for base-stealing potential against a slow-delivering pitcher, aligning with our strategic imperative to aggressively target stolen bases in this 5x5 format.\n\nWhile **Miguel Vargas** (45.60) and **Sam Antonacci** (48.61) land in the marginal tier due to a difficult matchup against Jared Jones, they remain active to ensure we maximize our daily game caps. The decision to start **Sam Antonacci** over potential alternatives was driven primarily by his lead-off role, which provides the most consistent path to runs and potential stolen bases despite the challenging xERA of the opposing starter. Currently, our bench is heavy with stalwarts like **Kyle Tucker**, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, and **Gunnar Henderson**, all of whom are sidelined today by team off-days. **Luis Robert Jr.** remains our primary IR concern, and we continue to monitor the status of depth pieces like **Andy Pages**, **Jackson Merrill**, **Jordan Westburg**, **Jacob Wilson**, **Nasim Nunez**, **Josh Jung**, **Coby Mayo**, **Henry Bolte**, **Tommy White**, **Curtis Mead**, **Franklin Arias**, **Dominic Smith**, **Wade Meckler**, **Liam Hicks**, and **Luis Lara** to ensure we have the necessary flexibility to pivot if any of our active starters are scratched once lineups are finalized. Keep a close watch on the weather and official confirmations for **Miguel Vargas** and **Sam Antonacci**, as the \"Lineup Pending\" status introduces moderate risk to their projected output.",
